sequenceDiagram
 title Sequence Diagram 4: Alternative Obtain Recommendations Flow
 actor User
 box Attraction Recommendation System
   participant WebApp
   participant Profile
   participant UserDatabase
   participant Recommender
   participant MuseumDatabase
 end


User->>WebApp: Open app and edits preferences
activate WebApp
WebApp->>Profile: Send updated preference
activate Profile
Profile->>UserDatabase: Update the user record
activate UserDatabase
UserDatabase-->>Profile: Profile saved successfully
deactivate Profile
deactivate UserDatabase
WebApp->>Recommender: Request new matching recommendations
Recommender->>MuseumDatabase: Fetch matching attractions
activate MuseumDatabase
MuseumDatabase-->>Recommender: Return new list of matching attractions
deactivate MuseumDatabase
activate Recommender
Recommender-->>WebApp: Send updated recommendations
deactivate Recommender
WebApp-->>User: Display new attraction suggestions
deactivate WebApp
